Description: Album-focused music client for MPD and Subsonic
 Freewave presents your library as a grid of album covers and keeps the
 play queue central. It connects to a Music Player Daemon (MPD) server or
 to any Subsonic-compatible server such as Navidrome, Gonic, Ampache or
 LMS.
 .
 Features include drag-and-drop queue management, server-native playlists
 and favorites, a real-time audio visualizer, and MPRIS desktop
 integration.
